{
  "_comment": "Purpose: Sensitive Data Protection (Cloud DLP) DeidentifyTemplate replacing detected banking PII with bracketed [INFOTYPE] tokens (e.g., [US_SOCIAL_SECURITY_NUMBER], [CREDIT_CARD_NUMBER]). Architecture/Context: Referenced by gateway/model_armor/ma-template.json.tmpl; upserted via dlp.googleapis.com/v2. Dependencies/Side Effects: Preserves surrounding JSON structure while masking sensitive values. Author: Pradeep Singh | License: Apache-2.0",
